; galvo_only.nc - the mirrors and nothing else.
;
; One M611 block and no M610 anywhere, so the gantry never receives a line
; and X/Y in the right panel stay exactly where they are. Use this to watch
; GX/GY on their own; use blocks.nc to see the stage and galvo take turns.
;
; 200 mm/s so the scan is watchable. The head is good to 20000 mm/s, at
; which this whole file is over in well under a second.
G21
G90
M611
F12000
